  "dialogue": [
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-001",
      "start_s": 88.01,
      "end_s": 90.0,
      "text": "Angela: Just took a little bit\nof work"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-002",
      "start_s": 90.0,
      "end_s": 92.03,
      "text": "and a whole lot of love."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-003",
      "start_s": 92.03,
      "end_s": 93.03,
      "text": "Muah."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-004",
      "start_s": 95.15,
      "end_s": 98.06,
      "text": "Are you ready to do this?\nAll right."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-005",
      "start_s": 98.06,
      "end_s": 100.19,
      "text": "Here we go."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-006",
      "start_s": 100.19,
      "end_s": 103.03,
      "text": "See?\nNow wasn't that easy?"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-007",
      "start_s": 215.17,
      "end_s": 218.11,
      "text": "See?\nNow wasn't that easy?"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-008",
      "start_s": 218.11,
      "end_s": 220.11,
      "text": "All it takes\nis some confidence"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-009",
      "start_s": 220.11,
      "end_s": 222.11,
      "text": "and a willingness\nto get started."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-010",
      "start_s": 222.11,
      "end_s": 224.17,
      "text": "And even though\nI'm not there,"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-011",
      "start_s": 224.17,
      "end_s": 227.11,
      "text": "I'll guide you\nthrough this."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-012",
      "start_s": 227.11,
      "end_s": 229.2,
      "text": "I want to thank\nmy very special assistant,"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-013",
      "start_s": 229.2,
      "end_s": 234.2,
      "text": "my daughter Zuri, for helping me\nwith today's vlog like always."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-014",
      "start_s": 234.2,
      "end_s": 238.01,
      "text": "And remember, the road\nahead might look rough,"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-015",
      "start_s": 238.01,
      "end_s": 240.12,
      "text": "but you can make the journey\nwith a little bit of work"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-016",
      "start_s": 240.12,
      "end_s": 242.16,
      "text": "and a whole lot of love."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-017",
      "start_s": 242.16,
      "end_s": 243.16,
      "text": "Muah."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-018",
      "start_s": 254.06,
      "end_s": 256.12,
      "text": "Are you ready to do this?"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-019",
      "start_s": 256.12,
      "end_s": 258.1,
      "text": "All right.\nHere we go."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-020",
      "start_s": 258.1,
      "end_s": 261.17,
      "text": "First you want to moisturize\nthese beautiful thick curls"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-021",
      "start_s": 261.17,
      "end_s": 265.11,
      "text": "with a leave-in conditioner, which\nwill also help detangle the kinks."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-022",
      "start_s": 265.11,
      "end_s": 269.2,
      "text": "Now, part all your hair\ninto sections and clip it away."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-023",
      "start_s": 275.17,
      "end_s": 277.23,
      "text": "You're doing an amazing job."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-024",
      "start_s": 283.06,
      "end_s": 284.22,
      "text": "Yay!\nYou did it!"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-025",
      "start_s": 284.22,
      "end_s": 286.15,
      "text": "That was so much fun."
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "hair-love-dialogue-026",
      "start_s": 288.06,
      "end_s": 290.05,
      "text": "I knew you could do it."
    }
  ],
